The BE will map incoming data from the BE from snake_case to camelCase.
The BE will map outgoing data to the BE from camelCase to snake_case.

### Expenses

| Method | Endpoint            | Purpose                     | Request Body         | Response        |
| ------ | ------------------- | --------------------------- | -------------------- | --------------- |
| GET    | `/api/expenses`     | List expenses (read model)  | —                    | `ExpenseRead[]` |
| GET    | `/api/expenses/:id` | Expense detail (read model) | —                    | `ExpenseRead`   |
| POST   | `/api/expenses`     | Create expense              | `ExpenseCreateInput` | `ExpenseRead`   |
| PATCH  | `/api/expenses/:id` | Update expense metadata     | `ExpenseUpdateInput` | `ExpenseRead`   |
| DELETE | `/api/expenses/:id` | Delete expense              | —                    | `200`           |


### Payments

| Method | Endpoint                   | Purpose                      | Request Body           | Response         |
| ------ | -------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -----------------------| ---------------- |
| GET    | `/api/payments?expense_id=` | List payments for an expense | —                      | `Payment[]`      |
| GET    | `/api/payments/:id`        | Get payment details          | —                      | `Payment`        |
| POST   | `/api/payments`            | Create payment               | PaymentInput           | `Payment`        |
| UPDATE | `/api/payments/:id`        | Update payment               | PaymentUpdateInput     | `Payment`        |
| DELETE | `/api/payments/:id`        | Delete payment               | —                      | `200`            |


### Settlements

| Method | Endpoint                      | Purpose                         | Request Body            | Response       |
| ------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----------------------- | -------------- |
| GET    | `/api/settlements?expense_id=` | List settlements for an expense | —                       | `Settlement[]` |
| GET    | `/api/settlements/:id`        | Settlement detail               | —                       | `Settlement`   |
| POST   | `/api/settlements`            | Create settlement               | `SettlementInput`       | `Settlement`   |
| PATCH  | `/api/settlements/:id`        | Update settlement               | `SettlementUpdateInput` | `Settlement`   |
| DELETE | `/api/settlements/:id`        | Delete settlement               | —                       | `200`          |


### Expense Invitations

| Method | Endpoint                                      | Purpose                                  | Request Body | Response                       |
| ------ | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------ | ------------------------------ |
| GET    | `/api/expenses/:id/invitations`               | List active invite metadata for a member | —            | `InvitationSummary[]`          |
| POST   | `/api/expenses/:id/invitations`               | Create/replace a seven-day invite link   | —            | New token (returned once) and expiry |
| DELETE | `/api/expenses/:id/invitations/:invitationId` | Revoke an invite link                    | —            | `204`                          |
| POST   | `/api/invitations/:token/join`                | Join an expense using an invite          | —            | `{ expense_id }`               |

The public preview is rendered at `/join/:token` and returns only the expense name and member names. The join endpoint requires an authenticated session.


### Users

| Method | Endpoint         | Purpose          | Request Body | Response         |
| ------ | ---------------- | ---------------- | ------------ | ---------------- |
| GET    | `/api/users`     | List all users   | —            | `UserPublic[]`   |
| GET    | `/api/users/:id` | Get user details | —            | `User`           |
| POST   | `/api/users`     | Create a user    | UserInput    | `User`           |
| UPDATE | `/api/users/:id` | Update user      | UserInput    | `User`           |
| DELETE | `/api/users/:id` | Delete user      | —            | `200`            |
